# Product, seq_no allocation (sequential and under concurrency via a
# SELECT ... FOR UPDATE lock on the owning design_session row), FR3's
# verified_against and FR4's signoff_status conditional-presence rules
# enforced in Go ahead of the DDL CHECK, entity_deltas.change rejecting
# "deleted", full JSON round-trip through ListBySession's seq_no order, the
# LB4 two-triple shape round-tripping both distinct and self-acting, and a
# structural assertion (NFR1) that RevisionEventStore exposes no
# Update/Delete/Amend verb. This target also carries
# open_questions_integration_test.go (issue #2545's Testing section, FR6):
